-
   APPEND("{proj-dir}/04-log.md",
     "\n## {ts.iso} · combine undo\nrestored from {latest}\n")
   → "  ✓ Restored phases/ from {latest}"
   CLEAR(W:active-program) ; DONE(code-dev-combine)
 
+# C8 dry-run guard (main combine flow) — `code-dev whatif` arms W:code-dev-dry-run.
+# Honor it BEFORE any mutating op: render the plan, never touch disk.
+IF RETRIEVE(W:code-dev-dry-run) ≡ true →
+  → "  (dry-run) PLAN — would combine the listed projects into one (snapshot + merged scaffold + meta rewrites)."
+  → "  Targets resolved above are rendered, not written. (dry-run ended — state unchanged)"
